abstract: >-
  Oracle3 provides agent tools and execution infrastructure for prediction markets.
  It exposes public market data, fee-aware checks conditional on supplied
  relationships, and a local paper ledger through MCP, alongside a separate
  Python trading engine. Development work includes explicit execution states
  and reproducible failure traces. Oracle3 builds on U Lab and Coinjure, with
  upstream attribution and licensing retained in NOTICE. Software regression
  results do not establish LLM effectiveness or live profitability.
